OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed after killing
OL,4,A'devoted' mum while fleeing police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dangerous driver has been jailed for
OL,7,F13 years after causing the death of a
OL,8,F"devoted" mum while he fled police.
OL,10,FMichael Connors went on the run to
OL,11,FIreland after killing Lydia La Polla,
OL,12,F47, in Wrexham in March 2025. He was
OL,13,Fextradited on an international arrest
OL,14,Fwarrant.
OL,16,FConnors, 28, had been driving at 71mph
OL,17,Fin a 20mph zone seconds before the
OL,18,Fcrash, which also seriously injured the
OL,19,Fvictim's husband Robert La Polla, 44,
OL,20,Fand a 16-year-old girl who was a
OL,21,Fpassenger in the car driven by the
OL,22,Fdefendant.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
