OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed after killing
OL,4,A'devoted' mum while fleeing police
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Simon Mills told Mold Crown Court
OL,7,Fthat Lydia's "excellent life was
OL,8,Fneedlessly cut short at the age of 47,
OL,9,Fnot far from her 25th wedding
OL,10,Fanniversary".
